phrase: sum histogram last tracking counts over final span {span}
phrase: aggregate frequency distribution across trailing window {span}
test: list=1,2,2,3,2,4,4 span=4
expect: => i=13 r=0.0 ok=true s="trailing window sum: 13" errors=0 n=7 res=[1,2,2,3,2,4,4] cache=0 hits=0
