phrase: gather elements backwards reaching ceiling {lim}
test: list=10,20,30,40 lim=50
expect: => i=1 r=0.0 ok=true s="collected in reverse: 1" errors=0 n=4 res=[10,20,30,40] cache=0 hits=0
