phrase: order subfunction outputs while below ceiling {cap}
slot: cap int
test: list=25,12,8,30,15 cap=20
expect: => i=3 r=0.0 ok=true s="subfunction sorted items: 3" errors=0 n=5 res=[8,12,25,30,15] cache=3 hits=0
